IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `mvtp-third-party-cover`

-- Motor Vehicles (Third-Party Risks and Compensation) Act 1960, ss 3, 3A, 4, 5, 7, 8, 9, 10-16 -- worked cases, from the seat of the driver or owner of a motor vehicle.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked against a
-- decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved). The relevant amount is supplied as 5000, the figure in s 2;
-- no order under s 20 was retrieved.
--
-- Fixtures are generated from tables of which flags are set (scratchpad
-- gen_motor-vehicles-third-party-risks-and-compensation-act-1960_baseline.py). Expected results were written by hand from
-- the text; the reason for each is in the generator's comments and, for the boundary cases, in the comments below.

§ `s 3 -- must I have cover, and does mine count`

`a complying policy` MEANS `My policy` WITH
    `in force for this use` IS TRUE
    `issued by an insurer lawfully carrying on motor insurance business in Singapore` IS TRUE
    `insuring against liability for death or bodily injury to any person from the use` IS TRUE
    `a certificate of insurance was issued for it` IS TRUE

`no policy` MEANS `My policy` WITH
    `in force for this use` IS FALSE
    `issued by an insurer lawfully carrying on motor insurance business in Singapore` IS FALSE
    `insuring against liability for death or bodily injury to any person from the use` IS FALSE
    `a certificate of insurance was issued for it` IS FALSE

`a policy with no certificate issued` MEANS `My policy` WITH
    `in force for this use` IS TRUE
    `issued by an insurer lawfully carrying on motor insurance business in Singapore` IS TRUE
    `insuring against liability for death or bodily injury to any person from the use` IS TRUE
    `a certificate of insurance was issued for it` IS FALSE

`no security` MEANS `My security` WITH
    `in force for the use` IS FALSE
    `given by an insurer or body approved by the Minister` IS FALSE
    `the amount of the undertaking in dollars` IS 0
    `a certificate of security was issued for it` IS FALSE

`an approved security for $45,000` MEANS `My security` WITH
    `in force for the use` IS TRUE
    `given by an insurer or body approved by the Minister` IS TRUE
    `the amount of the undertaking in dollars` IS 45000
    `a certificate of security was issued for it` IS TRUE

`an approved security for $225,000` MEANS `My security` WITH
    `in force for the use` IS TRUE
    `given by an insurer or body approved by the Minister` IS TRUE
    `the amount of the undertaking in dollars` IS 225000
    `a certificate of security was issued for it` IS TRUE

`driving uninsured in Singapore` MEANS `My use` WITH
    `where` IS `on a road in Singapore`
    `the occasion` IS `an ordinary use of an ordinary vehicle`
    `a public service vehicle` IS FALSE
    `the policy` IS `no policy`
    `the security` IS `no security`
    `I can prove the vehicle was not mine and not with me on hire or loan` IS FALSE
    `I can prove I was using it in the course of my employment` IS FALSE
    `I can prove I neither knew nor had reason to believe there was no complying cover` IS FALSE

`driving uninsured somewhere section 3 does not reach` MEANS `My use` WITH
    `where` IS `somewhere section 3 does not reach`
    `the occasion` IS `an ordinary use of an ordinary vehicle`
    `a public service vehicle` IS FALSE
    `the policy` IS `no policy`
    `the security` IS `no security`
    `I can prove the vehicle was not mine and not with me on hire or loan` IS FALSE
    `I can prove I was using it in the course of my employment` IS FALSE
    `I can prove I neither knew nor had reason to believe there was no complying cover` IS FALSE

`an owner with $125,000 deposited, driving uninsured` MEANS `My use` WITH
    `where` IS `on a road in Singapore`
    `the occasion` IS `the vehicle of an owner keeping $125,000 deposited, driven by the owner or an employee at work or under the owner's control`
    `a public service vehicle` IS FALSE
    `the policy` IS `no policy`
    `the security` IS `no security`
    `I can prove the vehicle was not mine and not with me on hire or loan` IS FALSE
    `I can prove I was using it in the course of my employment` IS FALSE
    `I can prove I neither knew nor had reason to believe there was no complying cover` IS FALSE

`driving on a complying policy` MEANS `My use` WITH
    `where` IS `on a road in Singapore`
    `the occasion` IS `an ordinary use of an ordinary vehicle`
    `a public service vehicle` IS FALSE
    `the policy` IS `a complying policy`
    `the security` IS `no security`
    `I can prove the vehicle was not mine and not with me on hire or loan` IS FALSE
    `I can prove I was using it in the course of my employment` IS FALSE
    `I can prove I neither knew nor had reason to believe there was no complying cover` IS FALSE

`driving on a policy with no certificate` MEANS `My use` WITH
    `where` IS `on a road in Singapore`
    `the occasion` IS `an ordinary use of an ordinary vehicle`
    `a public service vehicle` IS FALSE
    `the policy` IS `a policy with no certificate issued`
    `the security` IS `no security`
    `I can prove the vehicle was not mine and not with me on hire or loan` IS FALSE
    `I can prove I was using it in the course of my employment` IS FALSE
    `I can prove I neither knew nor had reason to believe there was no complying cover` IS FALSE

`a public service vehicle on a $45,000 security` MEANS `My use` WITH
    `where` IS `on a road in Singapore`
    `the occasion` IS `an ordinary use of an ordinary vehicle`
    `a public service vehicle` IS TRUE
    `the policy` IS `no policy`
    `the security` IS `an approved security for $45,000`
    `I can prove the vehicle was not mine and not with me on hire or loan` IS FALSE
    `I can prove I was using it in the course of my employment` IS FALSE
    `I can prove I neither knew nor had reason to believe there was no complying cover` IS FALSE

`a public service vehicle on a $225,000 security` MEANS `My use` WITH
    `where` IS `on a road in Singapore`
    `the occasion` IS `an ordinary use of an ordinary vehicle`
    `a public service vehicle` IS TRUE
    `the policy` IS `no policy`
    `the security` IS `an approved security for $225,000`
    `I can prove the vehicle was not mine and not with me on hire or loan` IS FALSE
    `I can prove I was using it in the course of my employment` IS FALSE
    `I can prove I neither knew nor had reason to believe there was no complying cover` IS FALSE

`an employee driving the employer's uninsured van, unaware` MEANS `My use` WITH
    `where` IS `on a road in Singapore`
    `the occasion` IS `an ordinary use of an ordinary vehicle`
    `a public service vehicle` IS FALSE
    `the policy` IS `no policy`
    `the security` IS `no security`
    `I can prove the vehicle was not mine and not with me on hire or loan` IS TRUE
    `I can prove I was using it in the course of my employment` IS TRUE
    `I can prove I neither knew nor had reason to believe there was no complying cover` IS TRUE

`an employee driving the employer's uninsured van, suspecting` MEANS `My use` WITH
    `where` IS `on a road in Singapore`
    `the occasion` IS `an ordinary use of an ordinary vehicle`
    `a public service vehicle` IS FALSE
    `the policy` IS `no policy`
    `the security` IS `no security`
    `I can prove the vehicle was not mine and not with me on hire or loan` IS TRUE
    `I can prove I was using it in the course of my employment` IS TRUE
    `I can prove I neither knew nor had reason to believe there was no complying cover` IS FALSE

#ASSERT `Does section 3 require cover for my use` `driving uninsured in Singapore`
#ASSERT NOT `Does section 3 require cover for my use` `driving uninsured somewhere section 3 does not reach`
#ASSERT NOT `Does section 3 require cover for my use` `an owner with $125,000 deposited, driving uninsured`

-- s 4(9): no certificate, no policy for the purposes of the Act. s 4(11)(b): $225,000 for a public service vehicle.
-- s 3(4): all three limbs, joined by "and", or the employee has no defence.
#ASSERT `Am I guilty of an offence by using the vehicle without cover` `driving uninsured in Singapore`
#ASSERT NOT `Am I guilty of an offence by using the vehicle without cover` `driving on a complying policy`
#ASSERT `Am I guilty of an offence by using the vehicle without cover` `driving on a policy with no certificate`
#ASSERT `Am I guilty of an offence by using the vehicle without cover` `a public service vehicle on a $45,000 security`
#ASSERT NOT `Am I guilty of an offence by using the vehicle without cover` `a public service vehicle on a $225,000 security`
#ASSERT NOT `Am I guilty of an offence by using the vehicle without cover` `an employee driving the employer's uninsured van, unaware`
#ASSERT `Am I guilty of an offence by using the vehicle without cover` `an employee driving the employer's uninsured van, suspecting`

#ASSERT `For how many months at least must I be disqualified from driving after a section 3 conviction` FALSE EQUALS 12
#ASSERT `For how many months at least must I be disqualified from driving after a section 3 conviction` TRUE EQUALS 0

§ `s 3A -- am I presumed to be the user`

#ASSERT `Am I presumed to be using the vehicle on a road in Singapore` `the recorded owner of a registered vehicle`
#ASSERT NOT `Am I presumed to be using the vehicle on a road in Singapore` `the lessor of an unregistered vehicle while it is leased out`

§ `s 4(4) -- what my policy need not cover`

`an ordinary road injury` MEANS `The injury` WITH
    `death or bodily injury caused by or arising out of the use of the vehicle` IS TRUE
    `to someone employed by a person insured by the policy` IS FALSE
    `arising out of and in the course of that employment` IS FALSE
    `to a platform worker providing a platform service for a platform operator insured by the policy` IS FALSE
    `arising out of and in the course of providing that platform service` IS FALSE
    `a contractual liability` IS FALSE

`my employee injured at work` MEANS `The injury` WITH
    `death or bodily injury caused by or arising out of the use of the vehicle` IS TRUE
    `to someone employed by a person insured by the policy` IS TRUE
    `arising out of and in the course of that employment` IS TRUE
    `to a platform worker providing a platform service for a platform operator insured by the policy` IS FALSE
    `arising out of and in the course of providing that platform service` IS FALSE
    `a contractual liability` IS FALSE

`my employee injured off duty` MEANS `The injury` WITH
    `death or bodily injury caused by or arising out of the use of the vehicle` IS TRUE
    `to someone employed by a person insured by the policy` IS TRUE
    `arising out of and in the course of that employment` IS FALSE
    `to a platform worker providing a platform service for a platform operator insured by the policy` IS FALSE
    `arising out of and in the course of providing that platform service` IS FALSE
    `a contractual liability` IS FALSE

`a platform worker injured on a delivery for me` MEANS `The injury` WITH
    `death or bodily injury caused by or arising out of the use of the vehicle` IS TRUE
    `to someone employed by a person insured by the policy` IS FALSE
    `arising out of and in the course of that employment` IS FALSE
    `to a platform worker providing a platform service for a platform operator insured by the policy` IS TRUE
    `arising out of and in the course of providing that platform service` IS TRUE
    `a contractual liability` IS FALSE

-- Both employment limbs are two-part: the status AND "arises out of and in the course of". Status alone excludes nothing.
#ASSERT NOT `Must my policy cover my liability for this death or injury` `my employee injured at work`
#ASSERT `Must my policy cover my liability for this death or injury` `my employee injured off duty`
#ASSERT NOT `Must my policy cover my liability for this death or injury` `a platform worker injured on a delivery for me`

§ `s 5 -- agreements with my passenger`

`a non-binding understanding with my passenger before the drive` MEANS `My passenger` WITH
    `section 3 required cover for my use` IS TRUE
    `carried in or on the vehicle, or getting in, on or out` IS TRUE
    `we had an agreement or understanding, binding or not` IS TRUE
    `made before the liability arose` IS TRUE
    `it restricts my liability or puts conditions on enforcing it` IS TRUE

`a release my passenger signed after the accident` MEANS `My passenger` WITH
    `section 3 required cover for my use` IS TRUE
    `carried in or on the vehicle, or getting in, on or out` IS TRUE
    `we had an agreement or understanding, binding or not` IS TRUE
    `made before the liability arose` IS FALSE
    `it restricts my liability or puts conditions on enforcing it` IS TRUE

`a passenger on a use section 3 did not reach` MEANS `My passenger` WITH
    `section 3 required cover for my use` IS FALSE
    `carried in or on the vehicle, or getting in, on or out` IS TRUE
    `we had an agreement or understanding, binding or not` IS TRUE
    `made before the liability arose` IS TRUE
    `it restricts my liability or puts conditions on enforcing it` IS TRUE

-- "whether intended to be legally binding or not"; an agreement made after the liability arose is not "antecedent".
#ASSERT `Is my agreement with my passenger of no effect` `a non-binding understanding with my passenger before the drive`
#ASSERT NOT `Is my agreement with my passenger of no effect` `a release my passenger signed after the accident`

#ASSERT `Does my passenger's willing acceptance of the risk negative my liability` `a passenger on a use section 3 did not reach` EQUALS `not covered by this encoding: section 5 does not apply, so the general law decides`

§ `ss 7 and 8 -- conditions and restrictions in my policy`

-- s 7(1) reaches only conditions about what is done or omitted AFTER the accident.
#ASSERT `Is my policy condition of no effect against the person I injured` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `Is my policy condition of no effect against the person I injured` FALSE TRUE

-- s 8(1) is a closed list of eight grounds.
#ASSERT `Is my policy's restriction of no effect against the person I injured` `the age or physical or mental condition of persons driving the vehicle` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `Is my policy's restriction of no effect against the person I injured` `a ground outside the section 8(1) list` TRUE TRUE

